Data Scientist at TGS

About TGS

Travel Global Systems (TGS), headquartered in Tel Aviv with a wing in Romania, focuses on providing innovative and affordable travel technology solutions for Travel Holdings, Inc.'s brands and its partners.

TGS was established in 2002, and provides B2B and B2C software solutions for handling large volume transactions and reservations within the travel industry.

The front-office and back-office TGS systems uniquely interface to emphasize yield management, speed, and simplicity for suppliers and agents.

TGS has developed patent-pending technology that provides instant inventory management; and pricing and accounting functionality for suppliers and clients - saving time and money reconciling accounts.

Job Description

The Data Scientist will lead analytics projects and will be responsible for architecting and implementing statistical,

data mining, optimization, and machine learning models.

Required Technical and Professional Expertise

·         Obtained BS.c or  Master’s  in Statistics, Applied Mathematics, Engineering, Operations Research, Computer Science, or other quantitative discipline

·         Expertise with advanced statistical or mathematical analyses (e.g., machine learning, predictive analytics, optimization, data mining)

·         Experience using one or more statistical programs (e.g., R, SPSS)

·         Have extensive experience troubleshooting and solving complex technical problems

·         Experience cleaning, restructuring, and merging large datasets

·         Experience creating compelling data visualizations of statistical analyses

·         Ability to program in one or more languages (Python, SQL)

·         Have 1+ years of experience

Besides that

·         Have tremendous communication skills

·         Be a great team player

·         Be very independent and very organized

·         Perfect English

·         Have a business understanding

·         Have 1+ years of experience

·         Locations  : center

Please reply with questions or CV.

